                       "description":  "The core recording workflow is straightforward: users click Start Recording to begin capturing, then Stop Recording to end the session. While recording, a live timer shows elapsed duration with a pulsing red indicator, and an event counter tracks the number of mouse and keyboard events captured. The recording captures three types of data simultaneously: mouse input, keyboard input, and screen video. Users configure the video FPS before starting. The start and stop buttons provide clear visual feedback about the current state and disable appropriately to prevent double-starts or premature stops.",
