                       "description":  "After stopping a recording, users see a summary of the captured session including duration and total event count. The last recording section persists until a new recording is started, allowing users to review and access the output files. Users can open the output folder containing the JSONL events file and video recording directly from the interface. This output data serves as input for creating State Machines that model complex user interaction patterns.",
